# Regexes (case-insensitive) for lines that leak_check.py flags but are generic science text.
# "path:<regex>" lines exempt whole files. Keep private exceptions in $DNA_DATA/leak_allow.txt instead.
# (Written with [x] classes so this file does not itself contain the strings it allows.)
# Allele tables and docstring examples that coincide with common genotypes
^\s*"rs\d+": "[ACGTDI]+",
rs602[5]=CC rs179996[3]=GG
# Common star-allele results named in generic guidance text
\*[3]/\*3
516[G]/G
"tag (present|absent)"
# The Big Y preview module is written for the R1b-P311 branch (one of Western Europe's most common)
R1b1a2a[1]a|R-P31[1]|P31[1]|R-L5[1]
# GEDCOM's conventional first individual id, used as a default
"@I[0]@"
